      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey @@{5bf14d69b146880205a1f304|full_name}, thanks for reporting this!\nWe're actually working on a system that lets world creators add some Udon UI functionality to the quick menu.\nIn the meantime, you can still create your own menus - but we'd recommend not tying your in-world menus to VRChat's official menu buttons.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-09T10:00:48.214Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The only workaround is to show the menu slightly in your point of view, then you can click on the menu.\nHolding Shift should let you access those menus while also serving as the player select hotkey if you hover on someone.\n\nExamples of affected worlds:\nTraveller's Rift - wrld_112c5336-0329-4293-83ac-96f37f8a6405\nStarfarer - wrld_e9ca960a-7b7b-4b2d-8133-5fe3d074512e",
